{
  "id": "p01-b-05",
  "title_zh": "全月总数较高，不代表每周都高",
  "topic_id": "learning",
  "scenario": {
    "id": "exam-answer-check",
    "label_zh": "核对图表试题答案",
    "goal_zh": "区分月度总数与每周比较并核对试题答案"
  },
  "participants": [
    "Rosa",
    "Malik"
  ],
  "context_zh": "学生带着练习试卷询问题目答案；图表中四月第三周的星期六售票六十张，星期日四十五张，但全月星期日总数较高。",
  "author": "author-phase01-b",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "p01-b-05-s01",
      "speaker": "Rosa",
      "text": "Can we check this question before the exam? Why is this statement false?"
    },
    {
      "id": "p01-b-05-s02",
      "speaker": "Malik",
      "text": "Read the statement aloud."
    },
    {
      "id": "p01-b-05-s03",
      "speaker": "Rosa",
      "text": "\"The museum sold more tickets on Sundays than on Saturdays in every week of April.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "p01-b-05-s04",
      "speaker": "Malik",
      "text": "Now look at the third week in the chart. How many tickets were sold on each day?"
    },
    {
      "id": "p01-b-05-s05",
      "speaker": "Rosa",
      "text": "Sixty on Saturday and forty-five on Sunday. I was looking at the monthly totals."
    },
    {
      "id": "p01-b-05-s06",
      "speaker": "Malik",
      "text": "That is a common mistake. What is the difference between the monthly total and what the question asks?"
    },
    {
      "id": "p01-b-05-s07",
      "speaker": "Rosa",
      "text": "Sunday sales were higher for the month as a whole, but not in every week."
    },
    {
      "id": "p01-b-05-s08",
      "speaker": "Malik",
      "text": "Exactly. That is the fact the chart supports."
    },
    {
      "id": "p01-b-05-s09",
      "speaker": "Rosa",
      "text": "So the statement is false, and the answer key is correct. Next time I will check the wording as well as the numbers."
    }
  ],
